@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Register : User initiates registration
Register --> Registration : Registration initiated
Registration --> Idle : Registration successful
Registration --> [*] : Registration failed

Idle --> Login : User initiates login
Login --> Authenticated : Login successful
Login --> [*] : Login failed

Authenticated --> LocationInput : User requests weather data
LocationInput --> WeatherCheck : Valid location entered
LocationInput --> [*] : Invalid location entered

WeatherCheck --> DataSelection : Location is valid
DataSelection --> WeatherDisplay : User selects weather data
WeatherDisplay --> WeatherDisplay : User requests additional details
WeatherDisplay --> Idle : User logs out
WeatherDisplay --> [*] : System error

@enduml
